title: Workspace across a restart: three folders known, one taken off the canvas, a widened panel; started again, the two on the canvas are read and the third is not
folders: rust-small, plain
fixtures: git-history
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: (?s)"workspace": \[.*rust-small.*plain.*git-history
again-expect-log: scanned 'git-history'
again-expect-log: scanned 'rust-small'
again-forbid-log: scanned 'plain'

wait 3500
left files
workspace put {FIX}\git-history
wait 2500
workspace off {FIX}\plain
wait 1500
ui drag 344 500 470 500
wait 700
goto src/util.rs
wait 1500
mark before-quit
wait 600
quit

=== again
wait 4000
mark after-restart
wait 600
left files
wait 700
mark after-restart-files
wait 600
quit
